\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_overview_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_row e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_overview_row\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_copy e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_overview_copy\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"en_overview_eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Shepherd Endowment Society<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"en_overview_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Income for the Manor, in perpetuity<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_p0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_overview_p0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Shepherds Endowment Fund was established in 2007 within the Good Shepherd Manor Foundation to provide a continuing source of income for Good Shepherd Manor and to do so in perpetuity.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_p1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_overview_p1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Endowment gifts are not spent but are invested to generate annual income far beyond the life of the donor. The investment income provides a stable funding source for future operating expenses of Good Shepherd Manor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_p2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_overview_p2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Shepherds Endowment Society makes a disbursement annually into the operating budget of Good Shepherd Manor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_imgcol e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_overview_imgcol\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_overview_img elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"en_overview_img\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1792\" src=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2266\" alt=\"Two people holding hands during Mass in the Manor chapel\" srcset=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-300x210.jpg 300w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-1024x717.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-768x538.jpg 768w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-1536x1075.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/dollars-at-work-5-2048x1434.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_quote e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"en_quote\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"en_quote\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_quote_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_quote_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_quote_p elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_quote_p\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote><p>\u201cThe SES helps the Manor have long-term financial security, which means long-term care for these special men. We want other families to feel the sense of contentment and peace knowing their loved one will have a home providing safe and compassionate care.\u201d<\/p><cite>SES Members \u2013 Ed and Joan O\u2019Brien, sister of a former resident<\/cite><\/blockquote>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_gift e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"en_gift\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"gift-options\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_gift_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_gift_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_gift_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"en_gift_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">So How Can You Ensure More Tomorrows?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_gift_p elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_gift_p\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>To advance our mission into tomorrow, and for all of the tomorrows beyond, we need your help.<\/p><p>You can simply choose, according to your own situation and preference, from the options listed below with a Current Gift or a Deferred Gift through your estate plan or a combination of gifts:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_gift_lists elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_gift_lists\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Current Gifts<\/h3><ul><li>Cash or Check<\/li><li>Debit or Credit Card<\/li><li>Recurring Gifts (e.g.: Monthly, quarterly, annually)<\/li><li>Current Pledge (e.g. within 3 years)<\/li><li>Stock\/Securities<\/li><li>Required IRA Distributions<\/li><li>Real Estate<\/li><\/ul><h3>Deferred Gifts<\/h3><ul><li>Bequest<\/li><li>Will or Living Trust<\/li><li>Beneficiary of Life Insurance<\/li><li>Pension Plan\/Other Qualified Plan<\/li><li>Closed Checking &#038; Savings Accounts<\/li><li>Real Estate<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_member e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"en_member\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"membership\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_member_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"en_member_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_member_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"en_member_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Membership<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_m_p elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_m_p\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Shepherds Endowment Society encourages and invites you to consider a gift at one of six membership levels.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_table elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_table\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table><thead><tr><th>Member Levels<\/th><th>Current Gift<\/th><th>Deferred Gift<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><th scope='row'>Innkeepers<\/th><td>$15,000<\/td><td>$30,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><th scope='row'>Angels<\/th><td>$30,000<\/td><td>$60,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><th scope='row'>Archangels<\/th><td>$50,000<\/td><td>$100,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><th scope='row'>Magi<\/th><td>$125,000<\/td><td>$250,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><th scope='row'>Guiding Stars<\/th><td>$250,000<\/td><td>$500,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><th scope='row'>Protectors of the Innocent<\/th><td>$500,000<\/td><td>$1 million or more<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-en_outro elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"en_outro\" data-e